{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q25048068","formula":"C₄₈H₆₂N₂O₈","hill":"C48H62N2O8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":48.0,"H":62.0,"N":2.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Buprenorphine/naloxone","ru":"Бупренорфин/налоксон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Buprenorphine/naloxone, sold under the brand name Suboxone among others, is a fixed-dose combination medication that includes buprenorphine and naloxone. It is used to treat opioid use disorder, and reduces the mortality of opioid use disorder by 50% (by reducing the risk of overdose on full-agonist opioids such as heroin or fentanyl). It relieves cravings to use and withdrawal symptoms.","ru":"Бупренорфин/налоксон, продаваемый под торговой маркой Suboxone и другими, представляет собой комбинированный препарат, включающий бупренорфин и налоксон. Он используется в сочетании с консультированием для лечения расстройства, связанного с употреблением опиоидов. Этот препарат уменьшает симптомы абстиненции примерно на 24 часа."},"fame":14,"pubchemCid":11274356,"mass":795.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]([C@H]1C[C@@]23CC[C@@]1([C@H]4[C@@]25CCN([C@@H]3CC6=C5C(=C(C=C6)O)O4)CC7CC7)OC)(C(C)(C)C)O.C=CCN1CC[C@]23[C@@H]4C(=O)CC[C@]2([C@H]1CC5=C3C(=C(C=C5)O)O4)O","inchikey":"SFNLWIKOKQVFPB-KZCPYJDTSA-N","iupac":"(4R,4aS,7aR,12bS)-4a,9-dihydroxy-3-prop-2-enyl-2,4,5,6,7a,13-hexahydro-1H-4,12-methanobenzofuro[3,2-e]isoquinolin-7-one;(1S,2S,6R,14R,15R,16R)-5-(cyclopropylmethyl)-16-[(2S)-2-hydroxy-3,3-dimethylbutan-2-yl]-15-methoxy-13-oxa-5-azahexacyclo[13.2.2.12,8.01,6.02,14.012,20]icosa-8(20),9,11-trien-11-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}},{"qid":"Q169336","names":{"en":"mixture","ru":"смесь","uk":"суміш"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"11274356","atoms":120,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.809,"y":-1.027,"z":3.59,"el":"C"},{"x":